  "content": "[F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]Day after day,\n[Em]love turns grey\nLike the\n[F]skin of a\ndying man.\n[C]\n[F]And\n[C]night after night,\nwe pre-\n[Em]tend its alright\nBut\n[Dm]I have grown\nolder and\nYou have grown\ncolder and\n[F]Nothing is\nvery much fun\n[G7]anymore.\n[Em]And\n[C]I\ncan feel\n[Em]\n[F]one of my\nturns coming\n[C]on.\n[F]\n[C]I\n[Em]feel\n[Dm]cold as a ra-\nzor blade,\nTight as a\ntourniquet,\n[F]Dry as a\nfuneral\n[G7]drum.\n[Eb]Run to [Bb]the bedroom, In the\n[Eb]suitcase on [Bb]the left You'll [C7]find my\n[Dm]favorite axe.\n[Dm]  [C]  [Dm]\n[Eb]Don't look [Bb]so frightened This is\n[Eb]just a passing [Bb]phase, [C7]One of\n[Dm]my bad days.\n[Dm][C][Dm]Would you\n[Eb]like to watch [Bb]T.V.? Or\n[Eb]get between the [Bb]sheets? Or [C7]contem-\n[Dm]plate the silent freeway? Would you\n[Dm]like [C]something to [Dm]eat? Would you\n[Eb]like to learn to fly?\nWould' ya? Would you\n[Dm]like to see me try?\n[C][Dm]Aah,\n[D]ooh, no\n[Dsus4]  [D]\n[G]\n[C]  [G]\n[Eb]  [Bb]\n[Eb]  [Bb]  [C7]\n[Dm]\n[Dm]  [C]  [Dm]\n[Eb]  [Bb]\n[Eb]  [Bb]  [C7]\n[Dm]\n[Dm][C][Bb][C]Would you\n[Eb]like to call the cops? Do you\nthink it's time I stopped?\nWhy are you running a-\n[Gm]way?",
